ARVDOUL VIBES — PART 2

Social Integration, Interactions, Messaging, Notifications, Coins, XP & Social Identity

(PART 2 — IMPLEMENTATION SPECIFICATION)

Objective: Transform the foundational Vibes experience delivered in Part 1 into a fully connected social experience within Arvdoul.

Part 2 connects Vibes to Arvdoul's existing social graph, profiles, messaging, notifications, Coins, XP, levels, achievements and moderation systems.

This is not a standalone social application. Vibes must operate as a native part of Arvdoul's existing ecosystem.

The implementation must preserve Part 1 functionality and extend it through reusable, secure and maintainable integrations.


---

1. Product definition

Part 1 established the foundational Vibes experience:

- Vibes Feed.
- Full-screen Viewer.
- Vibes Studio.
- Media creation and editing.
- Publishing.
- Audience privacy.
- Drafts.
- Expiration.
- Archive.
- Basic management.

Part 2 builds the social layer around that foundation.

Users should be able to interact with Vibes, share them, communicate with creators, manage relationships, receive relevant notifications and participate in Arvdoul's existing virtual economy and progression systems.

1.1 Part 2 product objectives

1. Make Vibes socially interactive.
2. Connect Vibes with existing profiles.
3. Integrate messaging and group conversations.
4. Implement secure sharing.
5. Connect Vibes to notifications.
6. Integrate Coins and gifting.
7. Integrate XP and levels.
8. Support achievements and milestones.
9. Enforce social relationship permissions.
10. Provide creator-side engagement information.
11. Prevent interaction abuse and economic manipulation.
12. Maintain a consistent experience across Arvdoul.

1.2 Product boundaries

Part 2 must integrate with existing systems instead of rebuilding them.

For example:

- If Arvdoul already has a messaging service, extend it.
- If Arvdoul already has a Coins wallet, integrate it.
- If Arvdoul already has an XP engine, extend its event handling.
- If Arvdoul already has notifications, add Vibes notification types.
- If Arvdoul already has a social graph, use its authoritative relationship model.

Do not create duplicate wallets, notification systems, messaging collections, profile databases or progression engines.


