4. Eligible notification.
5. Eligible progression update.
6. Analytics event.

Use a clear event flow.

19.4 Reliability

Where multiple systems must be updated, use an appropriate transaction or transactional outbox pattern.

Do not assume Firestore transactions can atomically cover external services such as FCM.

Design retries and idempotency around external side effects.


